345"\w* \w fiery|strong="H05135"\w* \w furnace|strong="H00861"\w*. \w Then what|strong="H04479"\w* \w god|strong="H00426"\w* \w will be able|strong="H01932"\w* \w -|strong="H01768"\w* \w to deliver you|strong="H07804"\w* \w from|strong="H04481"\w* \w my hands|strong="H03028"\w*?”
