\q2 \w and the books|strong="H05609"\w* \w were opened|strong="H06606"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w Then|strong="H00116"\w* \w I kept|strong="H01934"\w* \w watching|strong="H02370"\w* \w because of|strong="H04481"\w* \w -|strong="H07032"\w* \w the arrogant|strong="H07260"\w* \w words|strong="H04406"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01768"\w* \w the horn|strong="H07162"\w* \w was speaking|strong="H04449"\w*. \w As|strong="H05705"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01768"\w* \w I continued to watch|strong="H02370"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H01934"\w* \w the beast|strong="H02423"\w* \w was slain|strong="H06992"\w*, \w and its body|strong="H01655"\w* \w was destroyed|strong="H00007"\w* \w and thrown into|strong="H03052"\w* \w the blazing|strong="H03346"\w* \w fire|strong="H00785"\w*. \v 12 \w As for the rest|strong="H07606"\w* \w of the beasts|strong="H02423"\w*, \w their dominion|strong="H07985"\w* \w was removed|strong="H05709"\w*, \w but they were granted|strong="H03052"\w* . . . \w an extension|strong="H00754"\w* \w of life|strong="H02417"\w* \w for|strong="H05705"\w* \w a season|strong="H02166"\w* \w and a time|strong="H05732"\w*.
\s1 Daniel’s Vision of the Son of Man
\p \v 13 \w In my vision|strong="H02376"\w* \w in the night|strong="H03916"\w* \w I continued|strong="H01934"\w* \w to watch|strong="H02370"\w*,
\b 
\q1 \w and I saw|strong="H00718"\w* \w One like the Son|strong="H01247"\w* \w of Man|strong="H00606"\w*\f + \fr 7:13 \ft Or \fqa one like a son of man\f*
\q2 \w coming|strong="H00858"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01934"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05705"\w* \w with|strong="H05974"\w* \w the clouds|strong="H06050"\w* \w of heaven|strong="H08065"\w*.\f + \fr 7:13 \ft See Matthew 24:30, Matthew 26:64, Mark 13:26, Mark 14:62, Luke 21:27, Revelation 1:13, and Revelation 14:14.\f*
\q1 \w He approached|strong="H04291"\w* \w the Ancient|strong="H06268"\w* \w of Days|strong="H03118"\w*
